# Thalassa Mooring (CIPlay thalassa_mooring): the deck, the handbook, the water tower chest, the pipe crate, the office
# chest, the store shed, the diving bell ridden 20 m down (its zone has air).
island Thalassa Mooring
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Surface Station
zone deck
expect step 1
read Station handbook
expect step 2
open Water tower chest
wait 3
expect step 3
open Pipe crate
wait 3
expect step 4
open Station office chest
wait 3
expect step 5
open Store shed chest
wait 3
expect step 6
zone th_ridge
expect step 7
zone th_cave
expect step 8
read Dive log
expect step 9
read Dinghy logbook
expect step 10
use bell
wait 13
zone bell
air bell
expect done
